{"seq":1,"slug":"cutoff-leadtime-24hour-rule","title":"时限规则与截止时间建模：24 小时规则、装船前时限与倒排调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/predeparture-cargo-security-manifest-filing/filing-cutoff-transmission-integration/cutoff-leadtime-24hour-rule","wordCount":2787,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"时限规则与截止时间建模-24-小时规则-装船前时限与倒排调度\">时限规则与截止时间建模：24 小时规则、装船前时限与倒排调度</h1><p>一票从盐田发往汉堡的货，船期表上预计离港（ETD）周二 18:00。承运人给货代的文件截关（SI cut-off）是周一 12:00；美国 24 小时规则要求装船前 24 小时交舱单报文，欧盟 ICS2 也要求装船前 24 小时交 ENS。三个数字都叫&quot;截止时间&quot;，却锚在不同时刻、由不同主体执行、超时后果各异。把它们压成一个字段&quot;申报截止日期&quot;，是这套系统最常见的建模错误——船期一变，调度器就会给出错误的可用窗口。本文解决时限的<strong>可计算建模</strong>：把法规文本里的&quot;装船前 24 小时&quot;翻译成代码里可求值、可倒排、可随锚点漂移而更新的时刻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-cutoff-是三层时间约束-不是一个日期字段\">核心概念：cutoff 是三层时间约束，不是一个日期字段</h2><p>&quot;截止时间&quot;（cut-off / cutoff）在这套系统里至少有三层，自晚到早依次收紧：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>由谁设定</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>超时后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 法定截止</td>\n<td>regulatory cutoff</td>\n<td>海关法规</td>\n<td>最晚必须被海关<strong>受理</strong>的时刻</td>\n<td>违约赔偿 / 行政罚款 / 拒载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 作业截关</td>\n<td>operational cut-off（SI cut-off / CLS）</td>\n<td>承运人或 NVOCC</td>\n<td>承运人对外收单的内部死线</td>\n<td>甩柜（rolled cargo）、改配下一班</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 数据齐备</td>\n<td>data-ready deadline</td>\n<td>进口商 / 货代系统</td>\n<td>全部必填元素校验通过、可发起传输</td>\n<td>触发 L2 超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 上游采集</td>\n<td>upstream capture</td>\n<td>供应商 / 订舱系统</td>\n<td>元素源数据（装箱、报关、订单）到位</td>\n<td>触发 L3 超时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键结构是：<strong>L1 是外生的、不可协商的；L2 及更早各层是承运人为保护自己而人为设定的缓冲。</strong> 因此系统面向客户承诺的&quot;截止时间&quot;几乎总是 L2 而不是 L1——但合规判定看的永远是 L1，且判定依据是海关<strong>受理回执</strong>的时刻，不是报文<strong>发出</strong>的时刻。这两者的差值（传输时延 + 校验时延 + 重传时延）必须显式建模，否则会出现&quot;我们按时发了，但还是被罚&quot;的争议。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  T0[锚点事件&lt;br/&gt;装船完成 / 船舶离港 ATD] --&gt; T1[L1 法定截止&lt;br/&gt;= 锚点 − 法定前置期 L]&#10;  T1 --&gt; T2[L2 承运人作业截关 SI/CLS&lt;br/&gt;= L1 − 承运人缓冲]&#10;  T2 --&gt; T3[L3 数据齐备&lt;br/&gt;必填元素校验通过]&#10;  T3 --&gt; T4[L4 上游要素采集&lt;br/&gt;装箱 / 订舱 / 报关资料]&#10;  T1 --&gt; R1[传输与受理&lt;br/&gt;报文发送 --&gt; 回执确认]&#10;  R1 --&gt; R2{回执结果?}&#10;  R2 --&gt;|受理 ACCEPT| OK[合规成立]&#10;  R2 --&gt;|拒绝 REJECT| R3[修正后重传&lt;br/&gt;重试仍受 L1 约束]&#10;  R3 --&gt; R1\">flowchart TD\n  T0[锚点事件&lt;br/&gt;装船完成 / 船舶离港 ATD] --&gt; T1[L1 法定截止&lt;br/&gt;= 锚点 − 法定前置期 L]\n  T1 --&gt; T2[L2 承运人作业截关 SI/CLS&lt;br/&gt;= L1 − 承运人缓冲]\n  T2 --&gt; T3[L3 数据齐备&lt;br/&gt;必填元素校验通过]\n  T3 --&gt; T4[L4 上游要素采集&lt;br/&gt;装箱 / 订舱 / 报关资料]\n  T1 --&gt; R1[传输与受理&lt;br/&gt;报文发送 --&gt; 回执确认]\n  R1 --&gt; R2{回执结果?}\n  R2 --&gt;|受理 ACCEPT| OK[合规成立]\n  R2 --&gt;|拒绝 REJECT| R3[修正后重传&lt;br/&gt;重试仍受 L1 约束]\n  R3 --&gt; R1</pre><p>图中&quot;传输与受理&quot;回路挂在 L1 而非 L2 上——所有重试都消耗同一个法定窗口，这决定了重传策略必须<strong>幂等</strong>（见下文）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间锚点-把-装船前-翻译成机器可判定的时刻\">时间锚点：把&quot;装船前&quot;翻译成机器可判定的时刻</h2><p>法规文本说的是&quot;装船前 24 小时&quot;或&quot;离港前 24 小时&quot;，但&quot;装船&quot;是一个过程而非瞬间：一艘 24000 TEU 的船可能持续作业几十小时。锚点定义错误，整条倒排链就会整体偏移。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>锚点类型</th>\n<th>字段语义</th>\n<th>使用它的制度</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>装船（laden / on board）</td>\n<td>集装箱实际吊装上船的时刻</td>\n<td>美国 24 小时规则与 ISF</td>\n<td>规则原文为&quot;loaded aboard vessel&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>船舶实际离港（ATD）</td>\n<td>船体离开最后一个外国港</td>\n<td>承运人作业惯例</td>\n<td>比装船晚，是船长确认值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抵达首个入境港（ETA）</td>\n<td>抵达关境首站</td>\n<td>ICS2 空运（抵达前 4h）</td>\n<td>空运锚点在另一端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>wheels-up</td>\n<td>飞机离开最后一个外国机场</td>\n<td>美国 ACAS</td>\n<td>起飞时刻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件后计时</td>\n<td>事件发生后的滚动态</td>\n<td>承运人 CSM（状态报文）</td>\n<td>锚点反向：在途计时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>美国侧的两层制度锚点相同但主体不同：<strong>24 小时规则</strong>（2002 年 12 月 2 日生效）要求承运人在外国港口<strong>装船前 24 小时</strong>提交完整准确的海运舱单（AMS）；<strong>ISF 10+2</strong> 自 <strong>2009 年 1 月 26 日</strong>起适用，同为装船前 24 小时，主体是进口商 10 项、承运人 2 项（<a href=\"https://www.cbp.gov/border-security/ports-entry/cargo-security/importer-security-filing-102\">CBP：Importer Security Filing 10+2</a>）。承运人那 2 项（船舶积载计划 VSP、集装箱状态报文 CSM）<strong>锚点方向相反</strong>：VSP 约在船离最后外国港后 48 小时内、CSM 在每次状态事件后约 24 小时内提交（<a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-19/chapter-I/part-149\">19 CFR Part 149</a>）。同一 hub 里既有&quot;事前倒排&quot;的时限，也有&quot;事后滚动&quot;的时限，两者不能共用一套调度器。</p>\n<p>欧盟侧的 ICS2 ENS 时限按运输方式分档，一律锚在<strong>装运前</strong>：海运 24 小时、空运 4 小时（抵达首个欧盟机场前）、铁路 2 小时、公路 1 小时（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/customs-4/customs-security/ics2_en\">欧盟委员会 ICS2 专页</a>）。这组数字来自《欧盟海关法典》授权/实施条例对入境摘要申报的时限规定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"24-小时从何而来-以及它如何被缓冲侵蚀\">24 小时从何而来，以及它如何被缓冲侵蚀</h2><p>24 小时这个数字不是精确的风险计算，而是一个<strong>工程假设</strong>：远洋航程的最短时间足以让海关完成风险评分并回传&quot;是否布控&quot;。美、欧、加、日的海运制度都落在&quot;装船前 24 小时&quot;附近——加拿大 CBSA 的 ACI eManifest 海运同为装船前 24 小时、空运抵达前 4 小时（<a href=\"https://www.cbsa-asfc.gc.ca/prog/aci-manif-ipec/menu-eng.html\">CBSA：ACI/eManifest</a>）——这不是协调的结果，而是各自独立收敛到同一可操作数字。</p>\n<p>直接推论：<strong>凡航程短于或接近 24 小时的近洋/区域支线航线，法定前置期会吞噬几乎全部作业窗口。</strong> 亚洲区内航线航程常在 2–5 天，加上承运人缓冲，留给数据采集的时间被压到小时级；亚欧、泛太航线有 20–40 天航程，L1 相对宽松，真正的约束来自 L2 承运人截关。</p>\n<p>由此得到可用作业窗口。设制度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的法定前置期为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、承运人内部处理缓冲 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、数据装配与校验缓冲 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则可用于采集上游数据的窗口为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W(r,s) = L(r) - B_c - B_a - \\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 是传输与回执确认余量。<strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 才是调度器真正要保护的量</strong>，而不是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 本身。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 当成常数写死会在换承运人时失效——不同船司的截关提前量可以差半天以上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"倒排调度-从锚点逆推每一条-deadline\">倒排调度：从锚点逆推每一条 deadline</h2><p>把上面的结构写成算法，就是一个标准的<strong>倒排调度（backward scheduling）</strong>：从最晚的锚点事件出发，逐层减去前置期，得到每一层的&quot;最晚允许时刻&quot;（Latest Allowable Filing Time, LAFT）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LAFT</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>anchor</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LAFT}(r,s) = t_{\\text{anchor}}(s) - L(r) - B(r,s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LAFT</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">anchor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对每个申报单元 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>（注意是<strong>按制度 × 提单层级</strong>分别求值，不是对&quot;一票货&quot;求一次），计算它的 LAFT，再与当前计划时刻比较，得到松弛量</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Slack</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>LAFT</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>transmit</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Slack}(r,s) = \\text{LAFT}(r,s) - t_{\\text{now}} - \\tau_{\\text{transmit}}(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Slack</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LAFT</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transmit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>transmit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{\\text{transmit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transmit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是历史上该通道从发出到受理的时延估计。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Slack</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Slack} &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Slack</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 表示该申报已不可能在法定窗口内完成，系统必须在锚点前告警，而不是静默地&quot;尽力而为&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[读取船期与锚点&lt;br/&gt;ATD / laden 时刻] --&gt; B[按制度 r 与提单层级 s&lt;br/&gt;展开申报单元集]&#10;  B --&gt; C[查 L r:法定前置期&lt;br/&gt;海运 24h / 空运 4h 等]&#10;  C --&gt; D[LAFT = anchor − L r − B r,s]&#10;  D --&gt; E[Slack = LAFT − now − 传输时延]&#10;  E --&gt; F{Slack 判定}&#10;  F --&gt;|Slack ≥ 阈值| G[进入常规装配队列]&#10;  F --&gt;|0 ≤ Slack &lt; 阈值| H[升级为加急&lt;br/&gt;并行采集 + 预校验]&#10;  F --&gt;|Slack &lt; 0| I[不可达告警&lt;br/&gt;通知改配 / 说明迟到风险]&#10;  G --&gt; J[发起传输并跟踪回执]&#10;  H --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n  A[读取船期与锚点&lt;br/&gt;ATD / laden 时刻] --&gt; B[按制度 r 与提单层级 s&lt;br/&gt;展开申报单元集]\n  B --&gt; C[查 L r:法定前置期&lt;br/&gt;海运 24h / 空运 4h 等]\n  C --&gt; D[LAFT = anchor − L r − B r,s]\n  D --&gt; E[Slack = LAFT − now − 传输时延]\n  E --&gt; F{Slack 判定}\n  F --&gt;|Slack ≥ 阈值| G[进入常规装配队列]\n  F --&gt;|0 ≤ Slack &lt; 阈值| H[升级为加急&lt;br/&gt;并行采集 + 预校验]\n  F --&gt;|Slack &lt; 0| I[不可达告警&lt;br/&gt;通知改配 / 说明迟到风险]\n  G --&gt; J[发起传输并跟踪回执]\n  H --&gt; J</pre><p>倒排调度有两个必须处理的输入漂移。其一是<strong>锚点漂移</strong>：ATD 延误或提前会整体平移所有 LAFT，调度器必须支持锚点更新后重算，并区分&quot;已受理的申报&quot;（合规已成立，不回溯）与&quot;未发出的申报&quot;（按新锚点重算）。其二是<strong>层级依赖</strong>：House 级 ENS 依赖主提单数据，分提单的 LAFT 必须再减去主提单数据可得时间，否则会出现&quot;子申报就绪但父数据未到&quot;的空转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"报文传输与回执-deadline-不是-发出即完成\">报文传输与回执：deadline 不是&quot;发出即完成&quot;</h2><p>合规判定的时点是<strong>海关受理</strong>，不是本地发出，因此时限模型必须把传输层纳入，而不是把它当作&quot;发出去就行&quot;的黑盒。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>成功回执</th>\n<th>失败回执</th>\n<th>幂等键</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美国 AMS / ACE</td>\n<td>状态报文 Accept（受理）</td>\n<td>Reject（拒绝，含错误码）</td>\n<td>提单号 + 申报类型 + 版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟 ICS2</td>\n<td>MRN（Movement Reference Number）</td>\n<td>校验错误报告</td>\n<td>ENS 申报号 / 提单引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EDI 通用</td>\n<td>997 功能确认 / CONTRL（UN/EDIFACT）</td>\n<td>否定确认</td>\n<td>报文控制号（UNB/ISA）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AS2 传输</td>\n<td>MDN 回执</td>\n<td>传输失败</td>\n<td>Message-ID</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个工程后果：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>受理与发出之间有时延。</strong> 港口的报文通道常见批量处理窗口，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>transmit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{\\text{transmit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transmit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不是常数，时限模型要去测量它而非假设零延迟。</li>\n<li><strong>拒绝后重传仍受 L1 约束。</strong> 图 1 中的重试回路挂在法定窗口上，一次&quot;发即被拒&quot;就会消耗掉全部缓冲；系统应在本地做<strong>预校验</strong>（格式、必填、命名空间合法性），把可拦截的错误挡在传输之前。</li>\n<li><strong>重传必须幂等。</strong> 用提单号 + 申报类型 + 版本作为幂等键，避免网络超时后的盲目重发造成重复申报；欧盟侧要求同一 ENS 的更正以&quot;修改申报&quot;而非&quot;新建申报&quot;形式提交。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"时区-日历与漂移-把死线锚在稳态时钟上\">时区、日历与漂移：把死线锚在稳态时钟上</h2><p>时限建模最容易被低估的一层是时间本身。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>统一存 UTC。</strong> 锚点事件存为带时区的瞬间，比较一律在 UTC 下进行。欧盟与美国的夏令时切换日期不同，跨大西洋航线在切换周会凭空多出或少掉一小时的窗口。</li>\n<li><strong>工作日不等于自然日。</strong> 法定前置期多为自然小时（24h），承运人作业窗口按工作日与办公时间计算，两者混用会导致 L2 计算错误。</li>\n<li><strong>时钟偏移。</strong> 采集节点与海关通道的时间基准可能差秒级到分钟级，回执时间戳应以海关侧为准并记录来源。</li>\n<li><strong>迟交的现实处理。</strong> 已超时不因&quot;补交&quot;免责任，但优先级仍是<strong>尽快补交并保留说明</strong>——未申报（no filing）比迟申报（late filing）风险更高，会让货物在目的港直接进入查验或拒收。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>cutoff 是三层约束。</strong> L1 法定截止外生不可协商、L2 承运人作业截关、L3/L4 数据齐备与上游采集是人为缓冲；面向客户的承诺时间几乎总是 L2，合规判定看的永远是 L1。</li>\n<li><strong>锚点必须显式建模。</strong> 装船（laden）、离港（ATD）、抵达（ETA）、wheels-up 是不同瞬间，制度各锚一个；US 承运人那 2 项（VSP/CSM）锚点在事后，与事前倒排的时限不能共用调度器。</li>\n<li><strong>24 小时是工程假设，不是精确风险计算。</strong> 近洋航程短于或接近 24 小时时，法定前置期会吞噬作业窗口。</li>\n<li><strong>倒排调度给出 LAFT 与 Slack。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LAFT</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>anchor</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LAFT} = t_{\\text{anchor}} - L(r) - B(r,s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LAFT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">anchor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，按制度 × 提单层级分别求值；锚点漂移要重算，并区分已受理与未发出的申报。</li>\n<li><strong>deadline 是受理，不是发出。</strong> 传输时延、拒绝重传、幂等键都是时限模型的一部分；预校验是保护法定窗口的最后一道闸。</li>\n<li><strong>时间基准要稳态。</strong> 一律 UTC、区分自然小时与作业日、记录回执时间来源，避免时区与夏令时把死线算错。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>制度边界与触发条件见<a href=\"regime-matrix-isf-ics2-ams-aci\">制度全景与适用范围判定</a>；时限所依附的元素槽位见<a href=\"../security-manifest-regime-model/data-element-taxonomy-mapping\">数据元素分类与制度映射</a>；元素的上游来源与更新时点见<a href=\"../manifest-data-assembly-validation/manifest-data-sourcing-master-data\">舱单数据来源与主数据汇聚</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时限规则与截止时间建模：24 小时规则、装船前时限与倒排调度","id":"时限规则与截止时间建模-24-小时规则-装船前时限与倒排调度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：cutoff 是三层时间约束，不是一个日期字段","id":"核心概念-cutoff-是三层时间约束-不是一个日期字段"},{"level":2,"text":"时间锚点：把\"装船前\"翻译成机器可判定的时刻","id":"时间锚点-把-装船前-翻译成机器可判定的时刻"},{"level":2,"text":"24 小时从何而来，以及它如何被缓冲侵蚀","id":"24-小时从何而来-以及它如何被缓冲侵蚀"},{"level":2,"text":"倒排调度：从锚点逆推每一条 deadline","id":"倒排调度-从锚点逆推每一条-deadline"},{"level":2,"text":"报文传输与回执：deadline 不是\"发出即完成\"","id":"报文传输与回执-deadline-不是-发出即完成"},{"level":2,"text":"时区、日历与漂移：把死线锚在稳态时钟上","id":"时区-日历与漂移-把死线锚在稳态时钟上"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多单据一致性对账与差异处置：提单、舱单、发票与 HTS 的交叉核对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/predeparture-cargo-security-manifest-filing/manifest-data-assembly-validation/consistency-crossdoc-reconciliation"},"next":{"title":"报文传输与回执协议对接：EDI/XML 报文构造、ACK 解析与状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/predeparture-cargo-security-manifest-filing/filing-cutoff-transmission-integration/edi-message-transmission-protocols"}}